{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it recording now? ... Well let's start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello my fellow haulers. Welcome to our beautiful, democratic and fair universe, where you must work like a slave for your life under corporations that we assigned. During this peaceful working environment, you can face with a couple of unexpected adventures and some issues maybe... Not that much I hope. Before finishing the contract let me to give you a brief introduction. Because you will need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996710/extras/b74952d9b450620936af06f8a7dba6f6.avif?t=1758545882\" width=976 height=134 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your buddies and be a part of this unpredictable and- somewhat peculiar adventure. You need to be a group of 4 or less (for lonely souls, its also playeble alone but not recommended).</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996710/extras/862ccae8799753c5bd303792c85b7051.avif?t=1758545882\" width=976 height=134 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select your load and hit the road!. You\u2019ll face with diverse occasions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>depending on the cargo type and route you choose. Be careful about time, because you know, people don't like to wait for their precious new stuff.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996710/extras/a080b705a52758a3a7c9b895d3efb321.avif?t=1758545882\" width=976 height=134 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOnerarius\u201d is an old ship as you can see. So it needs some repair consistently. Depending on the room and unit that needs maintenance, you need to solve puzzles and complete minigames with the help of an \u201cOperator\u201d selected among the crew, and his guidebook.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996710/extras/1f1627ab479644eb4ff5a96f4fc31efe.avif?t=1758545882\" width=976 height=134 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have to be strict about your resources. They are crucial for you to succeed the shipment. Different problems need different resources to be solved, if you fail to manage them, you will fail the delivery ultimately. And at the end you will be fired. Or maybe we can cut your profit before firing you.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>There is much to talk about, but one important thing...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996710/extras/00267254b2bbc7234de51943460c8083.avif?t=1758545882\" width=976 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Because, when darkness falls some \u201cthing\u201d unfolds...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996710/extras/1e71ee9d687da6a24fcc5d09c6ad4b6b.poster.avif?t=1758545882\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996710/extras/1e71ee9d687da6a24